{%- comment -%}
  Stronicowany opis produktu (PDP v3) — „mini strony": tekst po lewej, grafika po prawej.

  Zrodlo tresci: ukryty .product-description-below (naglowek + akapity + SZCZEGOLY).
  Podzial stron + grafiki: metafield custom.story_pages (JSON):
    { "pages": [ { "paragraphs": 2, "image": "https://..." }, ... ], "details_image": "https://..." }
  Fallback bez metafielda: auto-podzial wg dlugosci tekstu, grafika = featured image.

  Assety (podpiete w sections/product-information.liquid): giclee-product-story.css / .js
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.description != blank -%}
  {%- assign story_mf = product.metafields.custom.story_pages -%}
  <section
    class="giclee-product-story"
    data-giclee-story
    {%- if story_mf != blank %}
    data-giclee-story-config='{{ story_mf.value | json }}'
    {%- endif %}
    data-giclee-story-fallback-image="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}"
    aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}"
  ></section>
{%- endif -%}
